jack_capture: jack_capture (program for recording soundfiles with jack)
jack_capture:
jack_capture: Jack_capture is a program for recording soundfiles with JACK.
jack_capture: The default operation of the program when executed from
jack_capture: the commandline is to record what you hear through your
jack_capture: loudspeakers into a stereo WAV file.
jack_capture: Supports all soundfile formats supported by sndfile (wav,
jack_capture: aiff, ogg, flac, wavex, au, etc.) and MP3 by using liblame.
jack_capture: It has an option for writing raw 16 bit data.
